DESCRIPTION:JT\nTomlinson is a Los Angeles-based stand-up comedian whose bl
 end of\nneurotic self-deprecation and witty observational comedy makes him 
 an\nintriguing and insightful joke-teller. Drawing from his experiences as 
 a\nrecovered addict\, former fat person\, and current twenty-something\, JT
 ’s\ncomedy is simultaneously silly and wise.\n\nJT\nhas recently been on 
 the road opening for Emily Catalano. When in LA\,\nhe performs weekly with 
 Don’t Tell Comedy in Los Angeles\, and recently\nlaunched his own Don’t
  Tell chapters in Long Beach and Palm Springs. He\nhas appeared at the Worl
 d-Famous Comedy Store\, the Hollywood Improv\, and\nWestside Comedy Theater
 \, and in 2023 began hosting at the Irvine Improv\nand Oxnard Levity Live. 
 His stand-up and sketch comedy videos have\ngarnered over 50 million views 
